	<tbody><tr>
          <td> <p align="center"></p>
            <p align="center"><strong>WHOLE GENOME COMPARATIVE ANALYSIS OF THE <i>Human Mar. 2006</i> GENOME</strong></p>
            </td></tr>
	  <tr>
	  <td valign="top" width="500" bgcolor="#cccccc" colspan="5">
	  </td></tr>
	  <tr>
		  <td>
<p>From this page you can access the results of:</p>

<p>the <b>multiple alignments</b></p>

  <ul>
	<li><p><a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/hg18/bigZips/">Human Mar. 2006</a>, <a href="http://genome.wustl.edu/pub/organism/Primates/Callithrix_jacchus/assembly/Callithrix_jacchus-2.0.2/">Callithrix jacchus v.2.0.2</a>, <a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/rheMac2/bigZips/">Rhesus Jan. 2006</a> and <a href="http://genome.wustl.edu/pub/organism/Primates/Pongo_pygmaeus_abelii/assembly/Pongo_pygmaeus_abelii-2.0.2/">Pongo pygmaeus abelii v.2.0.2</a> genomes.</p>
  </ul>	

  <ul>
	<li><p><a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/hg18/bigZips/">Human Mar. 2006</a>, <a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/mm9/bigZips/">Mouse Jul. 2007</a>, <a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/rn4/bigZips/">Rat Nov. 2004</a>, <a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/galGal3/bigZips/">Chicken May 2006</a>, <a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/downloads.html#dog">Dog May 2005</a>, <a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/rheMac2/bigZips/">Rhesus Jan. 2006</a> and <a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/equCab1/bigZips/">Horse Jan. 2007</a> genomes.</p>
  </ul>	




<p>the <b>pairwise alignments of the </b></p>
<p>
<a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/hg18/bigZips/">Human Mar. 2006</a> genome
	
		 produced by the
		<a href="http://www.genome.gov/11006939">International Human Genome Sequencing Consortium</a> 	
	
	
with the following genomes:
</p>

<ul>
<li><p>The <a href="http://genome.jgi-psf.org/Takru4/Takru4.home.html">Fugu rubripes v.4.0</a> genome

	 produced by the 
	<a href="http://www.jgi.doe.gov/">JGI</a>

</p>
</ul>

<ul>
<li><p>The <a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/panTro2/bigZips/">Chimp Mar. 2006</a> genome

	 produced by the 
	<a href="http://genome.wustl.edu/genome.cgi?GENOME=Pan%20troglodytes&SECTION=collaborators">Chimpanzee Sequencing and Analysis Consortium</a>

</p>
</ul>

<ul>
<li><p>The <a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/galGal3/bigZips/">Chicken May 2006</a> genome

	 produced by the 
	<a href="http://genome.wustl.edu/">Washington University School of Medicine in St. Louis</a>

</p>
</ul>

<ul>
<li><p>The <a href="http://genome.jgi-psf.org/Xentr4/Xentr4.home.html">Xenopus tropicalis v.4.1</a> genome

	 produced by the 
	<a href="http://www.jgi.doe.gov/">JGI</a>

</p>
</ul>

<ul>
<li><p>The <a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/downloads.html#dog">Dog May 2005</a> genome

	 produced by  
	<a href="http://www.broad.mit.edu/">The Broad Institute</a>

</p>
</ul>

<ul>
<li><p>The <a href="http://hgdownload.cse.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/danRer4/bigZips/">Zebrafish Mar. 2006</a> genome

	 produced by  
	<a href="http://www.sanger.ac.uk/">The Wellcome Trust Sanger Institute</a>

</p>
</ul>

<ul>
<li><p>The <a href="http://genome.jgi-psf.org/Triad1/Triad1.home.html">Trichoplax adhaerens v.1.0</a> genome

	 produced by the 
	<a href="http://www.jgi.doe.gov/">JGI</a>

</p>
</ul>
			


